  BookText: "Dear brother,\n\nwe are on our side ready to execute the next step of
    the plan, however - we shall wait for your drudgery before moving forward. You
    need to wreak havoc, scare to death that City, they have to know we are inside
    the walls and we're determined to kill every last one of them. \n\nOnce you've
    executed your duty, join Vera - she'll be at her hideout - at the farm. She will
    tell you what to do next.\n\nMy deepest regards, your brother in blood Martin."
  CantBeTaken: 0
